# ReviewShield

Follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).

- `POST /predictions/analyze` must not insert DB rows
- Missing reviewer history redistributes fusion weights
- Evaluation metrics require labels; never invent AUC
- Similarity must fall back from Sentence-Transformers/FAISS to TF-IDF/numpy
- Keep SQLite working; pgvector is optional Postgres-only
- Verify dashboard behavior in the browser after UI changes
